; Furnace Protocol II: original sampled industrial metal, 32 bars / 4 voices.
; A: power-chord guitar, B: grit bass, C: layered drums, D: gameplay effects.
; Rebuild WAVs with sound/tools/make_samples.py (deterministic synthesis).
#title Furnace Protocol II
#tempo 132
#inst chug samples/chug.wav root=e2 vol=52
#inst chord samples/chord.wav root=e2 vol=48
#inst bass samples/bass.wav root=e1 vol=44
#inst kickhat samples/kickhat.wav root=c3 vol=60
#inst snarehat samples/snarehat.wav root=c3 vol=54
#inst hat samples/hat.wav root=c3 vol=26
#inst tom samples/tom.wav root=c3 vol=48
#inst impact samples/impact.wav root=c3 vol=58
A o2 q8 l8
B o1 q8 l8 @bass
C o3 q8 l8

